<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CLAI — Feature Blueprint</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #030308;
            --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            --g1: #38bdf8;
            --g2: #a78bfa;
            --text: #f1f5f9;
            --text-dim: #94a3b8;
            --accent: #818cf8;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15), transparent 50%);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--g1), var(--g2));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .tagline {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--g1);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        code,
        pre {
            font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        code {
            padding: 2px 6px;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        pre {
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: var(--text2);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .copy-block {
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .copy-block h3 {
            color: var(--g2);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: var(--g1);
            color: #000;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="badge">AETHER-STITCH ERA</div>
            <h1>CLAI CORE BLUEPRINT</h1>
            <p class="tagline">The Ultimate Local AI Terminal Interface</p>
        </header>

        <section class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h2>◈ Neural Base</h2>
                <p>Private, local intelligence using <strong>Ollama</strong>. No cloud, zero latency. Built-in project
                    mapping with <code>/scan</code>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h2>🎞 Cinematic UX</h2>
                <p>Real-time <strong>Typewriter Mode</strong> for organic streaming. Premium 3D isometric logos with
                    shimmering neural reveals.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h2>🌌 Advanced VFX</h2>
                <p>Trigger <code>aurora</code>, <code>sync_weave</code>, <code>lexi_glow</code>, and
                    <code>ghost_buffer</code> for a sci-fi terminal experience.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h2>🛠 Interactive HUD</h2>
                <p>Embedded <code>[TIME]</code> menus, world clocks, system monitors, and dynamic memory selection.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="copy-block">
            <h3>◈ Full Command Reference (Copy-Paste)</h3>
            <pre>
/help        - View master command list
/status      - Session metrics & memory count
/models      - List all local Ollama models
/model [n]   - Switch active engine
/clear       - Wipe session history
/history     - Restore previous chat logs
