/code        - Task-specific programming logic
/explain     - Deep walkthrough of code blocks
/review      - Security & bug analysis
/improve     - Auto-refactor and optimization
/test        - Generate comprehensive unit tests
            </pre>
        </div>

        <div class="copy-block">
            <h3>▚ Visual Logic Tags</h3>
